<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>KLOCR Data Details</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Mixture</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We report the exact datasets used from AIHub in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.1 Mixture ‣ Appendix A KLOCR Data Details ‣ Exploring OCR-augmented Generation for Bilingual VQA" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
